  "description": "Native C# NFS client (ONC RPC, MOUNT v3, NFSv3, NFSv4.x) with a path-first mounted-session API for whole-file, ranged, and streaming I/O, directory listings with attributes, SETATTR, and optional portmapper discovery. Alpha.",
  "id": "OpenNFS.Client",
