  "published": "2026-10-03T07:54:40.79Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.2.0: built-in observability. OpenNFS now emits OpenTelemetry-shaped metrics and traces through the base class library (Meter and ActivitySource named OpenNFS.Server and OpenNFS.Client) with no new package dependencies and near-zero cost when nothing listens: per-procedure RPC duration and status, per-stage timing, NFSv4 COMPOUND operation spans, backend (file system and capability) calls, connections, NFSv4 state gauges, client RPC calls, retries, connection pool, and mounted-session operations. Subscribe by name from any OpenTelemetry host. See TELEMETRY.md and CHANGELOG.md.",
